  "description": [
    "A <em>C</em>-glycosyl compound consisting of a β-glucosyl residue having a (4-chloro-3-{4-[(3<i>S</i>)-tetrahydrofuran-3-yloxy]benzyl}phenyl group at the anomeric centre. A sodium-glucose co-transporter 2 inhibitor used as an adjunct to diet and exercise to improve glycemic control in adults with type 2 diabetes mellitus."
  ],
